  "ui_server_recording_transcription_and_media_mode_ba4c3058": "• Server recording, transcription, and media moderation will be unavailable.\n• Unsupported clients cannot join.\n• Participants, timing, track types, and traffic metadata remain visible.\n• Anyone can still record media on their own device.",
